# A run's folder commits two files: `report.json`, its facts, every step's record (which later runs
# size their steps by and take their released tests from) and its tables; and `listings.jsonl.gz`,
# every listing the witness's and the guesses' analyses read, a line each (`archive.gather`). The
# rest the run keeps on disk alone: each step's own record and listings under `records/`, the
# tables as CSV, the facts and run file `--resume` reads, the copies it fixed, its logs and patches,
# the Markdown docs/RUNS.md has.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!report.json
!listings.jsonl.gz
records/
work/
logs/
# Past each release's and the latest mega's and super's: on disk, not tracked (`scratch/retire_runs.py`).
